Print how to dispatch a role: the base member, the model alias and the effort.
.br
The base member is the one the profile names (worker for build, write and test, reviewer for review) when it is registered; otherwise the first registered member of the role's class (shown as legacy). A read\-only role never resolves to a member that can write. Plain output is one line: MEMBER MODEL EFFORT PROFILE; pass MODEL and EFFORT to the Agent tool with the member as subagent_type.
