.TP
.B qargi skill
Create or import skills and attach them by scope.
.PP
Skills and tools share one library with globally unique names; a link attaches one at a scope: user (every project and role), user\-role, project, or project\-role. Imported content is shown, hashed and approved before it is stored, and any later change is drift until you seal it again. Only you, with the person present, change a skill: a local member's guard refuses the verbs new, import, seal, remove, link, unlink, enable and disable, and writes in the pack library, and QARGI_NESTED does not stand in for the plan token of import and seal.
